      "Supplier",
      "Purchasing organization",
      "Business status",
      "Query-source completeness",
      "Structured business report"
    ]
  },
  "guardrails": {
    "zh": [
      "准时足量交付率(OTIF)按计划行和累计净收货计算",
      "少于 5 条到期计划行标记低样本",
      "缺少完整交期或收货日期时不计算正式准时足量交付率(OTIF)",
      "最长查询期间 365 天且只读"
    ],
    "en": [
      "Calculate On Time In Full (OTIF) by schedule line and cumulative net receipts",
      "Flag fewer than five due schedule lines as low sample",
      "Suppress formal On Time In Full (OTIF) without complete schedule or receipt dates",
      "Limit queries to 365 days and keep them read-only"
    ]
  },
